{"title": "Status properties/NonExtendable", "pageid": 35341, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/NonExtendable", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>NonExtendable</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_NonExtendable\">List of conditions with NonExtendable</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Dash\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is doubled.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Expeditious_Retreat\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat_(Condition)\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expeditious Retreat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Expeditious_Retreat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat_(Condition)\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat (Condition)\">Expeditious Retreat</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> available as a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Horde_Breaker\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Target)_(Condition)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Target) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Horde Breaker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Target)_(Condition)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Target) (Condition)\">Horde Breaker</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is open to a follow-up attack.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Horde_Breaker\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Condition)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Horde Breaker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Horde_Breaker_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Condition)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Condition)\">Horde Breaker</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Can attack a second creature close to its first target.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Melf's_Acid_Arrow\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_(Condition)\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_(Condition)\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow (Condition)\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage at the end of their turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215501\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1256/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17361/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3028/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 637006/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.673      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   29.673      1 -total\n 58.18%   17.263      5 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 53.98%   16.016      5 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 52.19%   15.487      5 Template:Icon_link\n 50.21%   14.897      5 Template:Icon_text\n 42.06%   12.479     10 Template:Trim\n 28.39%    8.423      5 Template:Ifempty\n  9.38%    2.782      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.39%    2.488      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35341-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215501 and revision id 330642. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}